    "description": " The Biology program prepares undergraduate students for graduate education in the allied health professions and in specialized fields of the biological sciences. Students who are interested in pre-medical, pre-dental, and pre-veterinary science programs should discuss appropriate course electives with their advisor.  \n\n\n\n",
